.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt WIT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wit
.Nd static git web frontend
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl O Ar owner
.Op Fl u Ar repo
.Fl o Ar outdir
.Ar repo ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes static HTML pages for git repositories into
.Ar outdir .
.Pp
Each
.Ar repo
is a bare repository or a working copy.
Its name is its directory's name without
.Pa .git .
Two repositories with the same name stop the run before anything is written.
A repository whose HEAD has no commits or is detached is skipped with a warning,
and so is one with a directory or a release that would overwrite a page.
.Pp
.Nm
writes no stylesheet.
Copy
.Pa style.css ,
.Pa favicon.ico
and the
.Pa fonts
directory from
.Pa /usr/local/share/doc/wit
into
.Ar outdir ,
and copy them again after changing them.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl O Ar owner
Show
.Ar owner
as the owner of every repository whose
.Pa owner
file is missing or empty.
.It Fl o Ar outdir
Write the site into
.Ar outdir .
.It Fl u Ar repo
Rebuild only
.Ar repo ,
which must be one of the listed repositories,
and any listed repository that has no pages in
.Ar outdir
yet.
The index is always written from every listed repository.
Without
.Fl u ,
every repository is rebuilt.
A rebuilt repository's old pages are deleted first.
.El
.Sh FILES
These files are read from a bare repository's directory,
or from a working copy's
.Pa .git
directory:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa description
The description shown on the index and the summary page.
git's placeholder text counts as none.
.It Pa owner
The owner shown on the summary page.
.It Pa releases/ Ns Ar tag Ns Pa /
The files of the release for
.Ar tag .
They are hard linked into
.Ar outdir Ns Pa / Ns Ar repo Ns Pa /releases/ Ns Ar tag Ns Pa / ,
or copied when that fails,
and listed with their sizes and SHA-256 sums,
next to zip and tar.gz source archives made by
.Xr git-archive 1 .
Subdirectories and symbolic links are ignored.
A directory that names no tag is skipped with a warning.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
Write a site for every repository in
.Pa /srv/git :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
wit -O alice -o /var/www/git /srv/git/*.git
cd /usr/local/share/doc/wit
cp -r style.css favicon.ico fonts /var/www/git/
.Ed
.Pp
Rebuild a repository's pages on every push, with a
.Pa hooks/post-receive
script in each repository:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
#!/bin/sh
wit -o /var/www/git -u . /srv/git/*.git
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr git 1 ,
.Xr githooks 5
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Miguel Leitão Aq Mt git@paramogi.world
